{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tale of the Demon Prince, returning from exile to reclaim his throne.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this little game, you will meet a host of unique characters and cut down legions of demons using a wide array of weapons, all in your quest to bend the Demon Kingdom to your will, conquering province after province and growing ever stronger with each step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 characters to meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96 provinces to conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast skill tree with over 100 abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique weapons, each of which changes the character models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of demonic monsters, each with their own powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A SPECIAL HIDDEN LUCK MECHANIC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I created this game to deliver the most satisfying, blood-soaked action possible without drowning it in bloated mechanics. Just pure, raw, <strong>JUICY CARNAGE </strong>and<strong>\u00a0</strong>silly, unserious dialogues with simple story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for blowing off steam after a long day, though be warned the early fights can be tough, you even can loose the campain in first turns, but don't worry, you just need to find your rhythm.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029430?t=1759166117","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029430?t=1759166117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029430/185e4e96784f3fbefa295299eb8799f2c6012825/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759166117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029430/185e4e96784f3fbefa295299eb8799f2c6012825/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759166117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"VIOLENCE, BLOOD, SEXUAL HARASSMENT"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tale of the Demon Prince, returning from exile to reclaim his throne.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this little game, you will meet a host of unique characters and cut down legions of demons using a wide array of weapons, all in your quest to bend the Demon Kingdom to your will, conquering province after province and growing ever stronger with each step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 characters to meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96 provinces to conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast skill tree with over 100 abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique weapons, each of which changes the character models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of demonic monsters, each with their own powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A SPECIAL HIDDEN LUCK MECHANIC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I created this game to deliver the most satisfying, blood-soaked action possible without drowning it in bloated mechanics. Just pure, raw, <strong>JUICY CARNAGE </strong>and<strong>\u00a0</strong>silly, unserious dialogues with simple story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for blowing off steam after a long day, though be warned the early fights can be tough, you even can loose the campain in first turns, but don't worry, you just need to find your rhythm.</p>","developers":["Arsen Kurbanov"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029430/8c5a122ff7051ebb49767d5cf872a638d1733c94/hea